  },
  'service-areas': {
    longTitle: "Towing Service Areas in Middle Georgia | Macon, Warner Robins, Byron & Beyond | (478) 500-8118",
    subtitle: "Serving Macon, Warner Robins, Byron, and Middle Georgia with fast towing and roadside assistance.",
    longDescription: `All Hours Towing Macon GA proudly serves a broad swath of Middle Georgia from our headquarters at 450 Martin Luther King Jr. Blvd in downtown Macon. Our primary service area includes Macon-Bibb County, Warner Robins and Houston County, Byron and Peach County, plus the surrounding communities that make up the economic heart of central Georgia. We provide 24/7 towing and roadside assistance along all major transportation corridors: I-75 from exits 144 to 185, I-16 from Macon eastward toward Dublin and Savannah, I-475 forming the western bypass of Macon, and state routes including GA-49, GA-96, US-41, GA-247, and GA-74. Our two-location strategy—primary dispatch in Macon and satellite staging in Warner Robins—ensures that no point in our coverage area is more than 25-30 minutes from a truck. From these bases, we serve cities and towns including Milledgeville, Forsyth, Fort Valley, Perry, Gray, and smaller communities like Lizella, Payne City, Centerville, Bonaire, and Kathleen. We also extend service to the South Atlanta suburbs—Conyers, Covington, and Monroe—and can arrange long-distance transport throughout Georgia and to neighboring states. Whatever the location and whatever the situation, our dispatchers at (478) 500-8118 know the roads, know the response times, and know exactly which truck to send. We're not a nationwide call center dispatching random contractors—we're your neighbors with three generations of Middle Georgia towing experience.`,
    faqs: [
